# The refusal names the declaration, the SOURCE ROLE the evaluation plan carried (not the minted binding id), the
# offending type and the suspension the value spans.
suspend-lowering: in `SuspendPlanBindingByRefLikeKt.cfbSpanArgumentAcrossSuspension`
the argument 's' of 'cfbLen'
which is byref-like (a `ref struct`, via `System.Span`)
lives across the suspending call to `cfbRelay`
(mirrors C# CS4007)
